        "nobel_worthiness": "Metamaterials made electromagnetic response an engineered design variable, enabling negative refraction and transformation-optics concepts once thought impossible.",
        "attribution": "Pendry supplied seminal theoretical proposals, and Smith provided influential experimental realization and demonstration.",
        "maturity": "The field is experimentally established and its methods have propagated widely through photonics and wave physics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Early claims of negative refraction and perfect-lens performance prompted methodological controversy.",
          "Applications have been less transformative than the original conceptual claims suggested."
        ]
      }
    },
